  "_about": "Skate vocabulary for search. brands and models map a canonical term to the other ways people type it; both product text and typed queries are rewritten to the canonical term, so either spelling finds the other. categories and stores turn a typed word into a filter (\"wheels\", \"tactics\"); keep those to words that mean the whole category or store. Matching ignores case and punctuation, and a phrase (\"formula 4\") matches as a whole. Edit freely; no code changes needed.",
